{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56915","headline":"崔巽遗言 · 佚名","name":"崔巽遗言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"安龙头，枕龙耳。\n不三年，万乘至。\n（同前）（按：《摭遗》云唐明皇猎於温泉，见一山上有新坟，张约随行，云葬失其地，引数语。\n询樵者，知爲崔巽墓。\n巽子告以遵父遗言葬此。\n诏蠲巽子终身徭役。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}